    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mel Davidson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113933159502575364044/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGgG65aCNzcy2Rkfm4rNdQ5-fYaqzaBhve5P5mINxYFYt6YqTH=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "It was our pharmacist since forever. Last week I went with my 88 yo dad with dementia that had a request from the Lakeshore Hospital to give him monthly day-by-day pills. Mr. St-Denis said: “well it’s a long process to prepare this for a month. You had to be sure that your dad is taking them. I don’t want to do this for nothing”\n\nHow can you say something like that? It’s your job\n\n*** Our local CLCS called him regarding this issue and he literally lied. After that, I did a formal complaint to the “association des pharmacists” ***",
        "time": 1698976075,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jay P",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117320175045882432230/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKg72JJbHRYcGXNRpwk4h9EjNzVXDbQj5JtdgNa8kZdK7wCNA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Serge (Pharmacist), Sherry (Pharmacist) and Caroline are always friendly and take the time to explain the medications. The store is a little dated but the level of service more than makes up for it.",
